  "facts_of_case": "Marriage between Govindasamy and M.Kanchana was solemnized in 1999. No child was born due to wedlock. The wife left the husband's company without proper cause, leading to a maintenance petition filed by her. The trial court partly allowed the petition, directing the husband to pay Rs.3,000/- per month.",
